&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/1f46e306f1cb442e93a526a7f135e9f4/reader/37" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;37呜呜呜呜！我好伤心！我好难过，我这么难过还写了5000+，你们不安慰我的话，我就要在书里掺屎！！&lt;/a&gt;
